  "description": "Pushed by someone and falling into the sea below a cliff, Jung-won loses all memories from after the age of 19.\nAlthough he has lost his memory, his love for photography remains vivid.\n\nHe tries to continue his college life to regain his normal routine, but the adult Jung-won has become a completely different person.\nHis childhood friend has become a casual sex partner, and he has no friends to interact with.\n\nJust as Jung-won feels miserable about himself, Sun-woo, a senior in his club, approaches\nhim, tells him about the secret he has been hiding, and helps him regain his memories.\n\nThe moment Jung-won thinks he can be happy just the way he is,\nthe karma of his past begins to strike him…!\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/505109598)",
